OL,13,G1600 Composer of the Week: Anonymous
OL,14,     F4/5. Donald Macleod presents
OL,15,     Fanother selection of anonymous
OL,16,     Fmusic and asks: when a work's
OL,17,     Fcreator is unknown, who else comes
OL,18,     Fto the fore in its story? With
OL,19,     FLisa Colton and Fay Hield.
